ce splits THIS wave, multi-zone shape** — new `apps/demos` on `/demos/*` rewrite, same-origin iframes, Railway service creation operator-paged (0400) · **sweep locks** — three bundle ledes rewrite to real members, platform-reads becomes canonical read-SQL home (fold-into-service rejected: sold package), audit-harness + demo-registry → `tooling/`, mechanical cut list executes fork-free (0401). Execution: five clustered PRs, ADRs ride PR 1.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        | ADR-0397–0401                                                                                                        |\n | D5 · discounted-close evidence (2026-07-26)                             | **One 40%-off design-partner close counts as list-price validation**, against the re-walk's HIGH-confidence recommendation to keep list-reaction and discounted-conversion ledgers separate. The single commercial instrument therefore cannot isolate discount sensitivity or support a full-price-elasticity claim; a future claim needs a new instrument.                                                                           