d\"**. D5 means one 40%-off close clears it, an easier bar than the re-walk assumed; the wedge gets neither an early pivot nor indefinite protection.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           | ADR-0391                                                                                                             |\n | D7 · three demand instruments (2026-07-26)                              | **Three instruments, against the re-walk's four-instrument recommendation**: D13 economic-buyer map first; one commercial instrument carrying D5's merged list/discount label; public developer distribution with its own denominator. The commercial leg inherits D5's full-price blind spot.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           